	(text_box "Orange: +12V (NS)\nBlack:  GND\nYellow: +5V\nRed:    +12V (S)\n\nIn the original PSU there are separate +12V \"stabilised\" and \"non-stabilised\" rails.\nThe NS rail was before the +12V regulation and the S rail was after the regulation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.31 147.32 0)
